msgid ""
"CORE creates a department, adds its members and appoints its head (by "
"invitation)."
msgstr "CORE vytvorí oddelenie, pridá členov a určí správcu (pozvánkou)."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/departments.html:73
msgid ""
"The head manages the PINs of the members, invites the delegates (at least 2)"
" and can hand the rights over temporarily until a date – the whole "
"department is informed by e-mail and the rights return automatically."
msgstr ""
"Správca spravuje PINy členov, pozýva delegátov (aspoň 2) a môže práva "
"dočasne odovzdať do dátumu – celé oddelenie dostane e-mail a práva sa vrátia"
" automaticky."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/departments.html:74
msgid ""
"When the head is not available, two delegates together can hand the head's "
"rights over to another delegate (at most 30 days) or invite another "
"delegate."
msgstr ""
"Keď správca nie je dostupný, dvaja delegáti spolu môžu jeho práva odovzdať "
"inému delegátovi (najviac na 30 dní) alebo pozvať ďalšieho delegáta."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/departments.html:75
msgid ""
"Heads ask each other to move people between departments; the head of the "
"other department approves."
msgstr ""
"Správcovia sa navzájom žiadajú o presun ľudí medzi oddeleniami; schvaľuje "
"správca druhého oddelenia."

