#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:7
#, python-format
msgid "You belong to the department <strong>%(name)s</strong>."
msgstr "Patríte do oddelenia <strong>%(name)s</strong>."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:7
msgid "You do not belong to any department."
msgstr "Nepatríte do žiadneho oddelenia."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:13
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>%(by)s</strong> invited you. Accept it with the code from the "
"e-mail, your PIN and 2FA."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%(by)s</strong> vás pozval. Prijmite to kódom z e-mailu, svojím "
"PINom a 2FA."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:16
msgid ""
"Your rights are handed over temporarily; they return automatically at the "
"end of the hand-over."
msgstr ""
"Vaše práva sú dočasne odovzdané; na konci odovzdania sa vrátia automaticky."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:17
msgid ""
"You asked to give the role up. It stays in force until a replacement "
"accepts."
msgstr "Požiadali ste o vzdanie sa roly. Platí, kým náhrada neprijme."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:23
msgid ""
"You manage the PINs of the people in your department and invite its "
"delegates."
msgstr "Spravujete PINy ľudí vo svojom oddelení a pozývate jeho delegátov."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:24
msgid "You can hand over your rights temporarily and approve moves of people."
msgstr "Svoje práva môžete dočasne odovzdať a schvaľujete presuny ľudí."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:26
msgid ""
"Together with the head or another delegate you confirm changes in your "
"department (four eyes) and handle resets."
msgstr ""
"Spolu so správcom alebo iným delegátom potvrdzujete zmeny vo svojom oddelení"
" (štyri oči) a riešite resety."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:28
msgid ""
"The PIN protects sensitive parts of NetBox and of other plugins that require"
" it – you share responsibility for this protection."
msgstr ""
"PIN chráni citlivé časti NetBoxu aj ďalších pluginov, ktoré ho vyžadujú – za"
" túto ochranu ste spoluzodpovedný."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:29
msgid ""
"Never give your PIN, 2FA or backup codes to anybody. Every action you take "
"is recorded in the audit log."
msgstr ""
"PIN, 2FA ani záložné kódy nikomu nedávajte. Každá vaša akcia sa zapisuje do "
"auditného záznamu."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:31
#, python-format
msgid "Accepted on %(date)s."
msgstr "Prijaté %(date)s."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:33
msgid "Give up this role"
msgstr "Vzdať sa tejto roly"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:35
msgid ""
"Without you the minimum would not be met: the role stays in force until a "
"replacement accepts."
msgstr "Bez vás by nebolo splnené minimum: rola platí, kým náhrada neprijme."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:41
msgid "Give up"
msgstr "Vzdať sa"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/my_roles.html:49
msgid "You have no role in the PIN administration."
msgstr "V správe PIN nemáte žiadnu rolu."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/not_allowed.html:3
msgid "PIN suspended"
msgstr "PIN pozastavený"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/not_allowed.html:3
msgid "PIN not permitted"
msgstr "PIN nie je povolený"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/not_allowed.html:8
msgid ""
"Your PIN was suspended by an administrator, so protected areas are not "
"available. Contact your administrator."
msgstr ""
"Váš PIN pozastavil administrátor, chránené časti preto nie sú dostupné. "
"Kontaktujte administrátora."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/not_allowed.html:10
msgid ""
"You are not permitted to use a PIN, so this protected area is not available "
"to you. Ask an administrator to allow PIN use for your account."
msgstr ""
"Nemáte povolený PIN, táto chránená časť preto pre vás nie je dostupná. "
"Požiadajte administrátora o povolenie PINu."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:3
msgid "Recover a forgotten PIN"
msgstr "Obnova zabudnutého PINu"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:8
msgid "Self-service recovery is not available for your account:"
msgstr "Samoobslužná obnova nie je pre váš účet dostupná:"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:11
msgid "Self-service recovery is turned off."
msgstr "Samoobslužná obnova je vypnutá."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:12 views.py:61
msgid "You are not permitted to use a PIN."
msgstr "Nemáte povolený PIN."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:13
msgid "NetBox cannot send e-mails."
msgstr "NetBox nevie posielať e-maily."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:14
msgid "Your account has no e-mail address."
msgstr "Váš účet nemá e-mailovú adresu."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:15
msgid "Your e-mail address is not in an allowed domain."
msgstr "Vaša e-mailová adresa nie je v povolenej doméne."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:20
msgid "Please ask an administrator to reset your PIN."
msgstr "Požiadajte administrátora o reset PINu."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:23
msgid ""
"Both are required: a code sent to your e-mail and a code from your "
"authenticator app."
msgstr ""
"Potrebné sú obe veci: kód poslaný na váš e-mail a kód z aplikácie "
"Authenticator."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:26
#, python-format
msgid "Send a code to <code>%(email)s</code>"
msgstr "Poslať kód na <code>%(email)s</code>"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:26
#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:28
msgid "code sent"
msgstr "kód odoslaný"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:33
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Enter both codes and choose a new PIN (%(n)s digits). The e-mail code is "
"valid for %(minutes)s minutes."
msgstr ""
"Zadajte oba kódy a zvoľte nový PIN (%(n)s číslic). Kód z e-mailu platí "
"%(minutes)s minút."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/recover.html:35
msgid "Set new PIN"
msgstr "Nastaviť nový PIN"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:3
#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:9
msgid "Access request"
msgstr "Žiadosť o prístup"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:13
msgid "Asked for"
msgstr "Žiadané"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:14
msgid "Why"
msgstr "Prečo"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:15
msgid "What exactly"
msgstr "Čo presne"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:17
msgid "none yet - it is created when you grant the access"
msgstr "zatiaľ žiadna – vytvorí sa, keď prístup udelíš"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:22
msgid "Put the user into a group"
msgstr "Zaradiť používateľa do skupiny"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:24
msgid "A new group"
msgstr "Nová skupina"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/request_decide.html:26
