msgstr "Potvrdenie resetu 2FA"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/reset_confirm.html:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>%(by)s</strong> started a reset of your PIN (valid until %(until)s)."
" Confirm with a code from your authenticator app (or a backup code) and "
"choose a new PIN (%(n)s digits)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%(by)s</strong> spustil reset vášho PINu (platí do %(until)s). "
"Potvrďte kódom z aplikácie Authenticator (alebo záložným kódom) a zvoľte "
"nový PIN (%(n)s číslic)."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/reset_confirm.html:11
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>%(by)s</strong> started a reset of your two-factor authentication "
"(valid until %(until)s). Confirm with your PIN; afterwards you set up 2FA on"
" your new phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%(by)s</strong> spustil reset vášho dvojfaktorového overenia (platí "
"do %(until)s). Potvrďte svojím PINom; potom si nastavíte 2FA na novom "
"mobile."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/reset_confirm.html:14
msgid ""
"If you did not ask for this, do not continue and contact your administrator."
msgstr "Ak ste o to nežiadali, nepokračujte a kontaktujte administrátora."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/set_pin.html:6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Choose a personal PIN of <strong>%(n)s digits</strong>. It protects "
"sensitive areas of NetBox."
msgstr ""
"Zvoľte si osobný PIN s <strong>%(n)s číslicami</strong>. Chráni citlivé "
"časti NetBoxu."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/set_pin.html:7
msgid "Repeated digits, sequences and simple patterns are not allowed."
msgstr "Opakované číslice, postupnosti a jednoduché vzory nie sú povolené."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/set_pin.html:8
msgid ""
"Nobody – not even an administrator – can read your PIN; an administrator can"
" only reset it."
msgstr ""
"Váš PIN nikto nevie prečítať – ani administrátor; administrátor ho môže iba "
"resetovať."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:10
msgid ""
"Read-only view. Only the master or delegates allowed to edit settings can "
"change them."
msgstr ""
"Iba na čítanie. Nastavenia môže meniť iba master alebo delegát s povolením."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:15
