msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "Rotácia"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:32
#: templates/netbox_user_pin/unlock.html:17
msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "Odomknúť"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:60
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Areas, their owners and the access grants are managed on the <a "
"href=\"%(areas_url)s\">Protected areas</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Oblasti, ich vlastníci a udelené prístupy sa spravujú na stránke <a "
"href=\"%(areas_url)s\">Chránené oblasti</a>."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:62
#, python-format
msgid ""
"E-mail, notifications and self-service recovery are configured under <a "
"href=\"%(mail_url)s\">Mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"E-mail, upozornenia a samoobslužná obnova sa nastavujú v časti <a "
"href=\"%(mail_url)s\">Mail</a>."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:68
msgid "Encryption key"
msgstr "Šifrovací kľúč"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:73
msgid "Active key"
msgstr "Aktívny kľúč"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:74
msgid "Fingerprint"
msgstr "Odtlačok"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:75
msgid "Configured keys"
msgstr "Nastavené kľúče"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/settings.html:78
msgid ""
"The key is stored only in the NetBox configuration "
"(<code>PLUGINS_CONFIG</code>), never in the database. Compare the "
"fingerprint with your offline backup. Rotate with <code>manage.py "
"userpin_rotate_key</code>."
msgstr ""
"Kľúč je uložený iba v konfigurácii NetBoxu (<code>PLUGINS_CONFIG</code>), "
"nikdy v databáze. Porovnajte odtlačok so zálohou. Výmena: <code>manage.py "
"userpin_rotate_key</code>."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:3
msgid "Backup codes"
msgstr "Záložné kódy"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:7
msgid ""
"New backup codes were generated; all previous codes are no longer valid."
msgstr ""
"Boli vygenerované nové záložné kódy; všetky predchádzajúce kódy prestali "
"platiť."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:10
msgid "used"
msgstr "použitý"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:14
msgid "Generate new codes? All current codes stop working."
msgstr "Vygenerovať nové kódy? Všetky súčasné kódy prestanú platiť."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:15
#: templates/netbox_user_pin/totp_manage.html:18
msgid "Generate new codes"
msgstr "Vygenerovať nové kódy"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:18
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Hotovo"

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:22
msgid ""
"An e-mail notification about this view was sent to you and the view is "
"recorded in the audit log."
msgstr "O tomto zobrazení vám bol poslaný e-mail a je zapísané v audit logu."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:24
msgid ""
"Confirm with your PIN and either a code from your authenticator app or a "
"verification code sent to your e-mail. The backup codes are shown only here,"
" never sent by e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Potvrďte svojím PINom a kódom z aplikácie Authenticator alebo overovacím "
"kódom z e-mailu. Záložné kódy sa zobrazujú iba tu, nikdy sa neposielajú "
"e-mailom."

#: templates/netbox_user_pin/show_backup_codes.html:28
